                <head>Interest of the United States in resolving the dispute between Afghanistan and
                    Iran regarding distribution of the waters of the Helmand River</head>
                <p>[Documentation on this subject, involving an offer by the United States of
                    informal good offices and the use of Washington as a neutral ground for informal
                    Afghan-Iranian discussion of the problem, is in Department of State files
                    501.BB, 790H.91, and 890H.6461.]</p>
            </div>
